# Phase 4b: two-line rows with mini art (docs/phase4b-brief.md, Agent C):
# an artist's "Albums" list (All Songs + its albums), the top-level Albums
# view, Podcasts and an episode list all use the two-line row (55 px
# thumbnail or glyph, bold title, "N Songs"/"N Episodes" subtitle); the
# blue unplayed dot on podcasts/episodes. Songs is two-line without art
# (ipodui-p4-sort.script).
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p4b-rows.script
# needs: library
# trace: lib art
# golden: skip albums_glide
#
# Cover-art variety for the rows below is in tests/ui/art_manifest.txt
# (tests/ui/setup_library.py); expect_art checks every album's state
# (OK / NOART / FAILED) against it once the builder is idle. "The
# Bellwethers" shows all three outcomes across its own three albums:
# Flock Together (embedded, OK), Shepherd's Delight (NOART, note glyph),
# Wool & Wire (cover.jpg, OK). Signal Hour has show art, Tone Talk Weekly
# does not. Trace rules (check_trace.py, "# trace: art"): thumbnails are
# read ("art get"), never mid-glide, at most once per newly visible row.

wait 4000           # boot to the main menu, "Music" selected
wait_db 30000
art_wait 120000     # every thumbnail built before the rows are shown
expect_art art_manifest.txt

key SELECT          # Music
wait 800
wheel +1            # "Artists"
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 800
wheel +5 300        # "The Bellwethers" (one row each, no acceleration)
wait 800
key SELECT
wait 800
shot artist_albums  # "All Songs" (note glyph), then Flock Together
                    # (mini art), Shepherd's Delight (note glyph), Wool &
                    # Wire (mini art)

key MENU            # back to Artists
wait 800
key MENU            # back to Music
wait 800
wheel +1            # "Albums"
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 800
shot albums         # the top-level Albums view, two-line rows throughout

wheel +16 40        # a quick turn: the view glides; rows coming into
shot albums_glide   # view show cached art or the glyph (timing)
wait 1500
shot albums_rest    # at rest: the new rows' art read and drawn

key MENU            # back to Music
wait 800
key MENU            # main menu
wait 800
wheel +1            # "Podcasts"
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 800
shot podcasts       # Signal Hour (show art), Tone Talk Weekly (glyph)

key SELECT          # "Signal Hour"'s episodes
wait 800
shot episodes       # blue unplayed dot, two-line rows

quit
